      Hey, I'm Konstantin - an indie developer. My main thing is
      <a href="https://voiceprompter.app">VoicePrompter</a>, a teleprompter that
      scrolls as you speak, used by creators in 125+ countries.
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="desktop-hint">↓ everything lives in the dock</p>
</Base>
